Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:08.58,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.59,0:00:11.09,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.29,0:00:14.49,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.89,0:00:19.89,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.87,0:00:27.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:33.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.77,0:00:40.07,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of\Ndeception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate\Nthe face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:51.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.07,0:00:55.07,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,When our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.47,0:00:58.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,On your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.37,0:01:01.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.87,0:01:04.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.97,0:01:07.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.27,0:01:11.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:16.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.67,0:01:22.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:02:01.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did you penetrate the Coast Guard's\Nsurveillance net as planned?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.19,0:02:01.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.09,0:02:04.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They opened a hole right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:15.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's the real thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:18.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now we're ready for war.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:21.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We didn't buy these to wage war.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,These weapons are powerful enough to\Nbe used for deterrence, instead of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.92,0:02:28.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is that Comrade Kuze's teaching?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:29.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.92,0:02:33.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wouldn't know, since I've never met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:35.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can't use the net, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:38.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,is Kuze really a revolutionary?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:40.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've heard rumours that he's got\NJapanese blood in him, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:44.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We don't know whether or not\Nhe's a true revolutionary,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:46.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but he has great ambition
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:49.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and the ability to take\Naction to achieve his goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.28,0:02:56.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Okay, let's bring in the cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:03:01.81,Sign - Copy,,500,0,500,,{\b1}Chain \N of \N Relativity{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:05.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fukuoka's electricity transmission\Ncircuits will temporarily shut down
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:11.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,if two or more points on the high-voltage\Ntransmission lines are over-stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:15.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As a safety precaution in such cases,\Nthe system is designed to default temporarily
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:17.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to a backup line to provide electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:21.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, by prompting a unidirectional\Nelectricity flow on the backup line as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:23.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the stress will trigger a\Nchain reaction of failures,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:26.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,resulting in a massive blackout in the\Ncapital, Fukuoka, within a matter of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:30.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It would be the same for any other city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.41,0:03:34.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They {\i1}are{\i} labourers who were\Nassembled to relocate the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.91,0:03:36.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The refugees are thorough, aren't they.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:40.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kuze must have taught them how\Nto trigger a massive blackout
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.21,0:03:46.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and then leaked to the net that refugees\Nmight launch a terrorist attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.71,0:03:47.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.21,0:03:50.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He is a worthy leader for the refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.06,0:04:04.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He made them reconsider suicide bombings,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:08.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and instructed the refugees on ways to\Nachieve freedom with very little loss of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:13.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have no idea how he tamed them\Nin such a short period of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.36,0:04:15.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but I can understand his thoughts very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.26,0:04:19.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kuze, I'll prepare the best scenario I can for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:38.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems Dejima has declared\Nitself an autonomous region.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:40.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.28,0:04:42.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is that Kuze's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:45.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kuze has not shown himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:46.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but there's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.58,0:04:52.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He is effectively using the net to\Ncommunicate the refugees' will to the media.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.88,0:04:57.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Nanyou News Agency is calling\Nhim the refugees' Che Guevara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.98,0:05:00.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,An invisible hero, again...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:07.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What I don't understand is that he was originally\None of the Individual Eleven, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:10.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why did the refugees accept him so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:14.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are we to believe that he\Nhas some special ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:16.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,just as the Major and Ishikawa have suggested?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:20.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We can only figure that out if we\Ncatch him and ask him directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:25.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We only have jurisdiction\Nhere because he's involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:27.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:34.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We must first defuse this situation by capturing\NKuze, since he is leading the refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.48,0:05:37.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After we accomplish that, we will secure the right\Nto challenge the Cabinet Intelligence Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.97,0:05:46.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There's a lot of them down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.27,0:05:54.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Doesn't it have something to\Ndo with the refugees uniting
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:57.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in response to the sentiments expressed\Nby the rest of the population?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.27,0:05:59.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In this kind of situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.87,0:06:03.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the ones who are more desperate tend to be\Nfaster at taking action and coming together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.87,0:06:08.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In reality, the legitimate citizens' actions are limited\Nto demonstrations against various government agencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.37,0:06:14.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I guess we could say the citizens are progressively\Npursuing a generalised particularism,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:16.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,or rather, an ostrich policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.97,0:06:19.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even though the refugees have\Nthrown down their gauntlets...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.97,0:06:23.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let us into Dejima!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:25.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Open the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.01,0:06:41.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou, you guys are on recon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.41,0:06:44.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Find out to what degree the\Nrefugees have armed themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.21,0:06:50.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll join you guys after Ishikawa and I\Ninfiltrate the refugees' network and find Kuze.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:51.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:04.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're from Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:06.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Seems the situation has got a lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.47,0:07:09.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The brass sure doesn't seem to think so,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:12.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,even though it's not looking good here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.67,0:07:17.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There are enough people who want to transfer\Njurisdiction to their pet militias, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.47,0:07:20.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You guys came as part of that whole\Ndeal, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:23.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is independent action, nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.57,0:07:24.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.47,0:07:27.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It'd be nice to have the freedom\Nto do our jobs, like you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.67,0:07:30.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, at least you have backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:40.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We need to hack a refugee's brain first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:43.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems Kuze's cyberbrain\Nis open to the refugees 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:47.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Until we get close to his ghost\Nline, no backups are necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:49.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:07:56.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,From the preliminary investigation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.73,0:08:00.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,there do not seem to be\Nconnections, such as cash flow,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:02.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,between Chief Cabinet Secretary\NTakakura and Poseidon Industrial.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.93,0:08:03.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:06.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Will we make the meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.03,0:08:08.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It doesn't look like there\Nwill be any problems right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.03,0:08:14.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, we have news regarding the Foreign\NMinistry worker whom you were to meet today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.33,0:08:15.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:17.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What news?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:21.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sir, Niihama Police just reported\Nvia the Kyodo News Agency
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.43,0:08:26.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that he has been run over by a subway train.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.93,0:08:31.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder what happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.53,0:08:35.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems there is something big hidden\Nbehind the security pact as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.43,0:08:37.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Return to HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:39.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:02.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's more active than I'd heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.18,0:09:07.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The refugees have been building on\Nthese high-rise slums for over twenty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:11.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's not altogether unwarranted of them to start\Ncalling the high-rises their own "castles".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:25.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll split up from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:27.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll take Azuma and Yano.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:30.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Pazu, Bomer, Saitou and Togusa:\Nyou guys form the other group.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:32.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If they have already secured weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.95,0:09:36.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,formed a militia,\Nand established a command infrastructure,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.65,0:09:38.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it'll be a lot harder to capture Kuze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:40.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:42.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll go hit opium town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.75,0:09:44.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If they've been assembling a militia here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.85,0:09:46.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,opium use will be up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:47.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.85,0:09:50.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll go check out the\Nblack-market weapons dealers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:51.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:10:01.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now, what's the shortest route to Kuze...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:03.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:06.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A female full-cyborg police\Nofficer is currently on duty
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:09.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in a police station in Dejima,\Naccording to shift records.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:12.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:13.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Pass me the visual feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:14.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.66,0:10:17.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They sure look bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:19.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Aren't they on alert for terrorist attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:20.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:22.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we'll borrow this woman's cyberbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:23.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:29.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's kind of unnerving with\Nthem sitting over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:31.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They'll hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:37.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,By the way, did you reformat\Nyour right arm's control system?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:41.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Seriously, you shouldn't upgrade control software.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.34,0:10:45.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,HQ to patrol sector 26, respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.84,0:10:48.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,H-Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.95,0:10:52.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:56.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:12.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:15.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems he's connected to Kuze this very instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:19.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Good, we'll trace this route\Nand confirm Kuze's position.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:20.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.27,0:11:26.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Jeez, these cyborgs...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:48.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A firewall maze?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.60,0:11:52.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,is he making it only accessible\Nto refugees via zoning?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:55.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We can't determine his current position.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:57.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The route's fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:12:00.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so I think he's somewhere in Dejima.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:05.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, that must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:09.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A huge number of refugees are accessing\Nit, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:17.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Still, aside from filtering I'm\Nnot noticing any special firewalls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:18.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:22.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, we'll all dive at\Nonce, before the enemy detects us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.24,0:12:23.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Prepare the Omni-sense mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.94,0:12:26.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Target: Kuze's visual field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:28.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We will determine his location from what he sees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:41.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The file on the Individual Eleven, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:42.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.27,0:12:46.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Right now, determining Kuze's\Nlocation comes first, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.61,0:12:51.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, create a backwards\Nfeed on the net from Gate 5
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:54.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and investigate the factors\Nthat attract refugees to Kuze.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:55.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.51,0:12:57.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, inject the mask array.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:12:59.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We will cross the ghost line with the Chroma file.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.59,0:13:08.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.19,0:13:11.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What a suffocating memory matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.19,0:13:12.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.09,0:13:14.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You must hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.09,0:13:16.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Omni-sense mask is deteriorating rapidly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.99,0:13:21.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.09,0:13:25.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you make a connection that\Ngoes any deeper, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.94,0:13:28.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's already seen through the Omni-sense mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:31.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Offensive firewalls won't have any\Neffect, so don't bother attacking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:32.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:35.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm saying that if you link to my\Nconsciousness, you'll regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:44.00,Dialogue,,250,0,650,,{\b1\i1}Houeimaru{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:44.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:48.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.11,0:13:51.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, what happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.01,0:13:52.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Drop the connection immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.04,0:13:53.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:14:00.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, get a hold of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:01.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.76,0:14:04.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, was it an offensive firewall?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:05.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:09.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But we couldn't detect any\Nviruses or offensive firewalls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:12.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We haven't been affected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:15.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Could it have been some sort\Nof hallucinogen or stimulant?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:18.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd find it hard to believe that the\NMajor would fall for something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.54,0:14:21.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:23.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.90,0:14:25.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:26.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:31.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A delusion...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.45,0:14:35.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.05,0:14:37.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,More importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.25,0:14:40.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,determine his hiding place from\Nthe information we stole from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:42.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:44.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.45,0:14:48.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's a formidable opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.65,0:14:51.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's on that ship right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:56.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition, I know him...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:14:59.29,Dialogue,,0,0,400,,{\b1\i1}Houeimaru{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:03.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:04.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh it's you, Kuze.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.40,0:15:05.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.10,0:15:07.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.50,0:15:11.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but there is a possibility that there will be a raid\Nby the police or some military special ops force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:14.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, you shouldn't\Nneedlessly engage in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:17.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hide your weapons and avoid\Nfighting as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:20.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please don't get yourself killed over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.28,0:15:58.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm not trying to be harsh here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.98,0:16:00.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but I recommend this eyeball.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.98,0:16:03.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see. Good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.58,0:16:04.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:08.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I bet you didn't think you\Ncould get body parts in Dejima,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.68,0:16:12.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but in reality, you can get almost\Nanything as long as you can pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:10.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Hey.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:12.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Can I have a joint, too?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:14.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}I wouldn't if I were you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:16.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Seems like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:19.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, did Kuze change his body here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:21.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, he didn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:24.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Another specialised body like his can't be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:26.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I just replaced his skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:27.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:28.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,His face...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:30.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I had it made by some face maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:33.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was one of a kind,\Nthough the mouth barely moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:36.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm surprised you knew a face maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.18,0:16:39.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Anyone would be eager to make\Na face for a guy like Kuze.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:44.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd be glad to do it if he were to come, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:50.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How does he attract such a following?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.23,0:16:52.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Eh, who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.73,0:16:57.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It may be that we're randomly getting\Ndrunk off the size of his ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.63,0:17:00.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The size of his ambition...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.33,0:17:02.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Batou.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:03.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.43,0:17:05.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}I have Kuze's location.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:09.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}He's at a camouflaged port on\Nthe northeastern tip of Dejima.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:13.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}There is a modified fishing {\i0}ship moored there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:13.33,Dialogue,,870,0,600,,{\b1\i1}Houeimaru{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:15.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}He is probably on that ship.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.53,0:17:19.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.13,0:17:20.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The information's not 100% positive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.63,0:17:23.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}We were detected at the last minute.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.13,0:17:27.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Right now, we're circling above that port.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.93,0:17:29.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}He hasn't left yet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:32.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We will catch him before he gets away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.83,0:17:34.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Rendezvous at the port ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.93,0:17:36.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:40.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:53.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's been settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:58.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tomorrow, we'll have hope, at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:17:59.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:02.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I thought you'd be the one to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.84,0:18:04.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:05.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's a revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.14,0:18:12.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Y-You're Kuze?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:15.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:18.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Aren't you... one of the...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:20.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Individual Eleven?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.12,0:18:28.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why are you a comrade?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:31.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're an enemy who killed a legend, Densetsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:32.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.37,0:18:41.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It is as you said,\NI am one of the Individual Eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.07,0:18:44.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then... why does everyone accept you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:46.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, listen a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:47.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.01,0:18:52.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you can't believe me, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.51,0:18:54.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Human beings cannot fully understand each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.01,0:18:56.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,For now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:59.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's enough that you realise\Nyou cannot understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:05.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My role is to guide you to\Nthe same point where I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.71,0:19:09.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, I cannot demonstrate that with\Nwords, only with actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.11,0:19:12.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you are still not convinced\Nafter seeing my actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.01,0:19:17.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,you have the option of leaving voluntarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:28.98,Dialogue,,0,575,500,,{\b1\i1}Houeimaru{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:28.98,Dialogue,,1000,0,160,,{\b1\i1}Houeimaru{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:28.98,Dialogue,,1200,0,700,,{\b1\i1}Houei{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.63,0:19:29.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.23,0:19:31.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, there are three boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.63,0:19:34.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're probably making it easier to slip\Nby the Coast Guard's surveillance net
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.73,0:19:37.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,by camouflaging them in the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.63,0:19:39.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The target is on one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:41.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,One of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.83,0:19:46.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,She appeared to have been attacked\Nwhen she tapped into Kuze's vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:48.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.63,0:19:49.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:52.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sweep each boat in pairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.53,0:19:53.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Go with thermo-optical camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.33,0:19:55.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The pairs will be Batou and Togusa;
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:56.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Pazu and Bomer;
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:19:57.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and Saitou and myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.33,0:20:01.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, Azuma and Yano will be backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.13,0:20:03.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, keep watch from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.99,0:20:32.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.49,0:20:34.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:20:48.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A live broadcast relay machine...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:50.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:54.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,An ambush?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:30.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did you come here... to catch Kuze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.67,0:21:38.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.27,0:21:40.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You fools...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:44.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kuze... won't be caught by the likes of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.97,0:21:50.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's... a real... hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:52.79,Dialogue,,1200,0,300,,{\b1\i1}Houeimaru{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.07,0:21:58.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why did they fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:03.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I told them not to die needlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.78,0:22:18.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.98,0:22:21.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's the first time we've had it this bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:22.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kuze isn't here,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.48,0:22:25.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,not to mention this was just an ambush
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.28,0:22:27.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and we've let a rookie die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.18,0:22:31.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.28,0:22:34.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kuze... was never here in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.36,0:22:44.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He is in Ostrov Iturup to buy plutonium
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.06,0:22:47.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,from the Russian mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:50.58,Main Dialogue,,320,0,150,,{\i1}Houeimaru{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.81,0:23:12.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.71,0:23:16.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.31,0:23:19.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.61,0:23:23.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.41,0:23:27.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.91,0:23:30.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.21,0:23:34.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.41,0:23:36.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.01,0:23:39.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.84,0:23:41.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.60,0:23:42.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.12,0:23:43.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.78,0:23:45.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.38,0:23:48.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is right)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.41,0:23:49.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.81,0:23:50.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.36,0:23:53.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.35,0:23:51.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.23,0:23:56.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.75,0:23:57.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.05,0:23:59.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.72,0:24:00.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.14,0:24:02.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.12,0:24:03.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.70,0:24:05.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.12,0:24:08.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.40,0:24:10.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.71,0:24:09.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.68,0:24:14.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.90,0:24:13.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.10,0:24:16.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.22,0:24:17.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.52,0:24:18.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.95,0:24:18.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,all I need,
